_enunciado_report_json_format", "label": "Incident Report JSON Format", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/enunciado.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fixed for interoperability: report_id (random UUID), incident_type, indicators (prefixes, ASNs, ports, protocols), observation_period (ISO 8601 UTC), severity, recommended_mitigation; security fields (signatures, timestamp tokens, pseudonyms) may wrap it."}, {"id": "docs_enunciado_corroboration", "label": "Anonymous Corroboration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/enunciado.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Corroboration count acts as confidence indicator; each member at most once per report and never on own reports."}, {"id": "docs_enunciado_dispute_resolution", "label": "Dispute Resolution", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/enunciado.pdf", "source_location": "p1-p2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "False reports could poison blocklists; only the Arbiter can reveal reporter identity, corroborators stay protected."}, {"id": "docs_enunciado_confidentiality", "label": "Confidentiality Requirement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/enunciado.pdf", "source_location": "p2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_enunciado_anonymity", "label": "Anonymity Requirement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/enunciado.pdf", "source_location": "p2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_enunciado_authenticity", "label": "Authenticity Requirement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/enunciado.pdf", "source_location": "p2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_enunciado